    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the world of Spirit Realm Saga, where you can immerse yourself in a plethora of gaming delights, including role-playing, Roguelike adventures, tower defense, strategy, simulation, and puzzle-solving.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>In the ethereal realm of spirits, you will assume the role of a courageous hero entrusted with the task of rescuing NPCs possessed by malevolent spirits. Recruit them to your cause and unite to confront adversaries on all fronts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/ad300426158cb2ddb5509d664d93e66c.poster.avif?t=1746753789\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/ad300426158cb2ddb5509d664d93e66c.webm?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/ad300426158cb2ddb5509d664d93e66c.mp4?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the game world to gather a diverse array of resources, which you can utilize to forge formidable weapons and equipment. Additionally,  craft and deploy cunning traps to establish defensive fortifications and  repel monstrous assaults.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/f6251f8028f74ba6e3dcc6d1e9617a55.poster.avif?t=1746753789\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/f6251f8028f74ba6e3dcc6d1e9617a55.webm?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/f6251f8028f74ba6e3dcc6d1e9617a55.mp4?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash the power of the enigmatic Spirit Crystals to transcend into a state of soul separation, embarking on a transcendent journey into the Spirit Realm. Brace yourself for encounters with fiercer demons and daunting challenges that lie ahead.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/e839700aa6e23d50e8021efcd94f2493.poster.avif?t=1746753789\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/e839700aa6e23d50e8021efcd94f2493.webm?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/e839700aa6e23d50e8021efcd94f2493.mp4?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With wisdom and valor, chart your legendary tale amidst the veiled enigmas and uncertainties of this realm. Forge your own path to glory!",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to the world of Spirit Realm Saga, where you can immerse yourself in a plethora of gaming delights, including role-playing, Roguelike adventures, tower defense, strategy, simulation, and puzzle-solving.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>In the ethereal realm of spirits, you will assume the role of a courageous hero entrusted with the task of rescuing NPCs possessed by malevolent spirits. Recruit them to your cause and unite to confront adversaries on all fronts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/ad300426158cb2ddb5509d664d93e66c.poster.avif?t=1746753789\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/ad300426158cb2ddb5509d664d93e66c.webm?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/ad300426158cb2ddb5509d664d93e66c.mp4?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the game world to gather a diverse array of resources, which you can utilize to forge formidable weapons and equipment. Additionally,  craft and deploy cunning traps to establish defensive fortifications and  repel monstrous assaults.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/f6251f8028f74ba6e3dcc6d1e9617a55.poster.avif?t=1746753789\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/f6251f8028f74ba6e3dcc6d1e9617a55.webm?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/f6251f8028f74ba6e3dcc6d1e9617a55.mp4?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash the power of the enigmatic Spirit Crystals to transcend into a state of soul separation, embarking on a transcendent journey into the Spirit Realm. Brace yourself for encounters with fiercer demons and daunting challenges that lie ahead.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/e839700aa6e23d50e8021efcd94f2493.poster.avif?t=1746753789\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/e839700aa6e23d50e8021efcd94f2493.webm?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736080/extras/e839700aa6e23d50e8021efcd94f2493.mp4?t=1746753789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With wisdom and valor, chart your legendary tale amidst the veiled enigmas and uncertainties of this realm. Forge your own path to glory!",
    "short_description": "Spirit Realm Saga is an indie game that combines elements of role-playing, Roguelike, strategy, simulation, tower-defense, and puzzle-solving. It offers players a challenging and explorative game world with\u00a0a mix of different gameplay mechanics.",
